Aim: Hands-on parallel exploration of Terraform, and its configurations

Project Structure:
student-api/
└── terraform-lab/
└── main.tf
Program:
main.tf

resource "terraform_data" "student_api_lab" {
  input = "Student API infrastructure lab"
}

output "lab_message" {
  value = terraform_data.student_api_lab.output
}

Implementation:
Open the terminal in terraform-lab.

Step 1: Initialize Terraform
terraform init

Step 2: Preview changes.
terraform plan

Step 3: Apply the configuration.
terraform apply
When prompted, type yes.

Step 4: Retrieve the output.
terraform output

Step 5: Destroy the resource.
terraform destroy
